  "definition": "River corridor",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-05-25",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1800) #8326, eff 4-21-05; ss by #9330, eff 11-26-08 (from Env-Wq 1802.13); renumbered by #9657 (from Env-Wq 1802.15); ss by #12185, eff 5-25-17",
